<<has entity=`band` name=`foreign` params=`exit/3 fields/[[radius root rows exit]] ~ a hand changed a target the house last wrote`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`unreachable` params=`exit/4 fields/[[radius root rows exit]] ~ a target reads unreachable`>>
```

